          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, the EcoFlow DELTA Pro 3 is the portable power station for home backup to buy: 4kWh of LiFePO4, 120V and 240V from one unit, room to expand, and a smart panel option when you are ready to wire it in. If your heaviest load is a 240V well pump, the Anker SOLIX F3800 Plus has the inverter headroom. If you want most of the house covered, the DELTA Pro Ultra is a home battery in all but name.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
